; RUN: @iriec --target mos6502 --emit=asm @file

; Corpus: llvm-mos-reference/constraints/compare-flags
; (a < b) & (b < c) & (a != c), the i1 results combined and widened to the char result.
; 
; CHECK pins Irie's current --emit=asm output (characterization / golden).
; Compare against ext/llvm-mos-reference/constraints/compare-flags.s; close gaps via irie-report.

; CHECK: compare_flags:
; CHECK:     STA $07
; CHECK:     LDA $02
; CHECK:     STA $08
; CHECK:     LDA $04
; CHECK:     STA $06
; CHECK:     TXA
; CHECK:     EOR #$80
; CHECK:     TAY
; CHECK:     LDA $03
; CHECK:     EOR #$80
; CHECK:     STA $02
